<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rome-te</book>
  <para style="h">Rome-te</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rome-te</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rome-te</para>
  <para style="mt">Rome-te</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ lungdamna thu gen dinga ei kituomkoi, sawltahpi dinga ei kihlan, Jesu Khris’ nasem keima Paul in kang hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien in Lai Siengtho sungah a kamsangte tungtawnin a na ciemkholsa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua pen cilesa lamah David’ suon a Tapa tawh kisai lungdamna thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siengthona hlagau’ lamsangah misite lah panin vanglietna tawh a thawsahkiana ziehin Pasien’ tapa Topa Jesu Khris a hina thu a pholah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama tungtawn le ama’ min ziehin Gentile-te zosie lahah upna le thumanna a op thei nadingin kote in hepina le sawltahpi za ka nga vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jesu Khris a nei dinga a kihlan mite lahah note zong na kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misiengthote ahi dinga kihlan Rome khuo-a om Pasien in a it mi zosie tungah: I Pa Pasien le Topa Jesu Khris tung panin hepina le lungmuonna note tungah ang tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A masa-in leitung mun zosie-ah na upna uh kithang ahi ziehin note zosie ziehin Jesu Khris’ minin ka Pasien tungah nuomthu ka tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tatsat loin ka thungetnate ah note kang phawden lamtah, ama tapa’ lungdamna thu hilin ka lungsim tahpi tawh ama’ na ka seppieh Pasien ka teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien’ deina a op leh lam khat popo panin na kung vuah a sawt loin kang haw thei teitei nadingin thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note ang thakhausah ding Hlagau letsong pawlkhat kang hopsawn thei nadingin note kang mu ding ka lunggul mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi sihle note’ upna le keima’ upna khatlekhat tha i kipieh thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sanggam pasalte le sanggam numeite aw, Gentile dangte lahah ga ka law bangin, note lahah zong ga pawlkhat ka law thei nadingin (ahi vangin tu tanpha-in ei kikhahtan hi) na kung vua haw ding ka sawmsawm hi, ci nei theipi ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Greek-te le tuolniem mite tungah leibat ka nei bangin, mi pilte le mi mawte tungah zong ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Rome khuo-a om note kungah zong lungdamna thu hil ding ka lawp mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in lungdamna thu ka maizumpi sih hi; tua thu pen a um zosie in hutdamna a nga nading Pasien’ vanglietna ahi hi. A masa-in Jew mite ading ahi a, Greek-te ading zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Midih pa in upna tawh a nungta ding hi,” ci-in a kigiel bangin lungdamna thu sungah upna tawh Pasien’ dihna ang kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasien um lote le migilote in a gitlona utawh thuman thutah a netcip ziehun vantung panin amate zosie tungah Pasien’ thangpaina ang kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen amate tungah Pasien in lah zo ta ahi ziehin, a thei ding vua kilawm nate amate tungah cientahin a kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leitung a siemcil a kipan ama’ pienzie ahi a tawntung vanglietna le Pasien ahina thute a kimu thei lo vangin a piensah nate panin kitheitelin kimu zo ta ahi ziehin amate in paulap ding a nei sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile amate in Pasien thei sam napi ahina za-in Pasien a zatah sih vua, ama tungah nuomthu zong tut loin a lungsim vuah thu ginalo vive ngaisunin a mot lungsim uh a miel keikui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pil a kisah vangun mimaw ahi bo uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />amate in a si thei mihing, vate, keng li nei ganhingte, le a bawhva ganhingte tawh a kisun limte po tawh a si thei lo Pasien’ vanglietna a khel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a pumpi uh amate ma in a sietsah thei nadingun, Pasien in a lunggulna uh zui-in pahtatna sungah amate a pie dawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in zuouthu tawh Pasien’ thuman thutah a khel vua, kumtawna kipatawi ding ahi Siempupa sangin ama’ siemsate bie-in a na uh a sem zawsop uhi! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin Pasien in amate zumhuoi huasanna sungah a pie dawh ta hi. A numeite un ngaina banga pasal tawh optonna pen ngaina ahi lo tawh a khel vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tua ma bangin pasalte in zong a ngaina banga numeite tawh a optonnate uh nuasie-in pasal le pasal po a kilunggul vangut uhi. Zum mel nei loin pasal le pasal a omton vua, tuaci’n amate in a khielna utawh kituohin dan a thuoh ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien a thei nop lo ziehun a kilawm lo-a gamta dingin Pasien in amate lungsim hoi lo a guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gitlona namcin, sietna, duhopna, mudana, ki-enna, tuolthana, kihauna, kisolna, mi gensietna tawh a kidim vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />mi daisahte, Pasien mudate, a kihisahte, a kigolsahte, a kisielte, thusie suite, le nu le pa thu manglote,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />mi mawlawmte, upna nei lote, itna nei lote, hepina nei lote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in tua banga gamtate a si dinga kilawm ahi hi, ci-in Pasien’ thukhenna thei napi, tua banga a gamtat paupau ban vuah tua banga a gamtate nangawn a thukimpi lai vaset uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin midangte tunga thukhen note pen koikoi na hi zongun hamlap ding na nei sih uhi; bangzieh ahei cile midangte tunga thu na khen uh ciengin noma zong tua bang lien ma-a gamta veve na hi ziehun no le no kimawsah na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Note in, “Tua banga a gamta mite tungah Pasien’ thukhenna pen thuman thutah tawh kituoh ahi hi, ci i thei uhi,” na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Koikoi hi nan locin tua banga gamtate tungah thu khen napi, no zong tua bang ma-a na gamtat veve uh ciengin Pasien’ thukhenna panin a suohta dingin na kingaisun uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi sihle a kicing ama’ migitna, a thuohhatna le a lungduoinate simmaw na hi uh amah? Pasien’ migitna in kisiakiana lamah note ang pui ahi lam thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin lungtang khau-in na kisia nop lo ziehun Pasien’ lungthahna le a thukhenna dihtah ang kilah ni hun ciengin na thuoh ding uh ahi lungthahna a kholkhol na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile ama in mi zosie tungah amau’ gamtatna tawh kituohin a thuhkia ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hoi gamtatna le lungduoina tawh minthanna, patawina le si thei lona a sui mite tungah kumtawn hinna a pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama’ ang sung beh khuolin thuman thutah zui loin gitlona a zuite tungah a lungthahna le a lunghamna a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sietna a bawl mi zosie tungah lungkhamna le gimna tung ding a, a masa-in Jew mite tungah tungin Greek-te tungah zong tung ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahi vangin a hoi a bawl mi zosie tungah vanglietna, patawina, le nopsahna tungin a masa-in Jew mite tungah tungin Greek-te tungah zong tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien in angvan tuom a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thukham lo tawh a maw mite pen thukham lo ma tawh kisie ding a, thukham khut nei-a a maw mite zosie pen thukham ma in thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien muna-ah thukham a zate a dih hi loin, thukham a zuite beh a dih hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukham nei lo Gentile-te in a pienpi uh lungsim bangin thukham in a kalh thute a sep uh ciengin amate in thukham a nei sih vangun, amate adingin tua thute thukham suoh veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lungsim sung vuah thukham in a kalh thute kigiel hi, ci-in amate in a lah vua, amau’ kitheina lungsim in zong teci a pang hi. A kitukal a lungsimte un amate mawsah zelin maisah zel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />keima’ lungdamna thu dung zui-in Jesu Khris tungtawnin Pasien in mi zosie’ phuolsel ngaisutnate a khen ni ciengin tam bangin a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin nangma le nangma Jew mi khat ka hi hi, kici-in thukham tungah na kingah a, Pasien tawh na kizopna na kisielpi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thukham na sinna ziehin ama’ deina thei-in a hoi pente a khen thei pa na hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mittawte lamlah pa, khuomiel sunga om mite adinga khuovah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mimawte thu a hil pa, naupangte’ siepa, thukham zieha pilna le thuman thutah nei na hi tahtah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />nang, midangte a hilpa, nangma le nangma kihil phot lo ding na mah? Guhtat lo ding a genpa, nangma in zong gu hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Angkawm sih un a ci pa, nangma in angkawm hi lo na mah? Milim a kidahpa, nangma in milim biehinnpi bulu hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thukham a kisielpi pa, nangma in thukham palsatna tawh Pasien’ min daisah hi lo na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile, “Note ziehin Gentile-te lahah Pasien’ min kigensie hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thukham na zui uleh tep tanna in phattuomna nei a, hinanle thukham na palsat uleh na tep tanna uh teptan lo ma a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n teptan lote in thukham in a kalh thute a zui uleh a teptan lo uh pen teptan ma bangin kisimpieh lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n tahsa tep tan sih nan ule thukham a zuite in, tep kitanin a kigiel thukhamte nei napi tua thukhamte a palsat note tungah thu hing khen ding uh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi khat pen a putham beh tawh Judah mi ahi sih a, tep tanna tahtah i ci zong tahsa le a putham beh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Judah mi i cite pen a sung lama Judah mi ahite hizaw a, teptan tahtah i ci zong lai-a kigiel thukham zieh hi loin, hlagau lam tawh kisai-a lungsim teptanna ahi hi. Tua bang mi in midangte tung pan hi loin Pasien tung panin phatna a nga hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile Jew mite in bang hamphatna nei ahi uh ahei? Tua ahi sihle teptan a manphatna bang ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lam tampi-ah phattuomna a om hi. Azieh pen a masa penin Pasien’ thuphuonte gen dingin Jew mite kingansie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte muonhuoi sih leh bang a ci ta diei? Amau’ uplona in Pasien’ citahna maimangsah ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maimangsah vawt lo ding hi! “Na thukhenna-a na zawna ding le ka kammal ah dihna na tan nading ahi hi, ci-in a kigiel bangin, mi zosie in zuouthu gen nan ule, Pasien’ thumanna kilang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite’ dih lona in Pasien’ dihna a lah leh eite in bang i gen ta ding vuoi? Eite tungah a lungthahna ang tunsah ziehin Pasien a thuman lo ahi ta amah? (Mihingte gen banga ka gen ahi hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi vawt lo hi! Tua bang hi mawh leh Pasien in leitung mite tungah thu bangci khen thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima’ zuouna ziehin Pasien’ thumanna in a minthanna khangsah ahile, bang dingin mawnei khat bangin kei thu ei khen lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale (pawlkhat in i ham ding uh bawltawmin eite ei daisah bangin) bang dingin, “A pha a pien nadingin a sie bawl vai,” ci lel lo i hi uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Amau’ dan thuoh pen a thuoh tah ma ahi bo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile bang himawh ahei! Eite i hoizaw tuom uh amah? I hoizaw tuom vawt sih uhi; azieh pen Jew mite le Greek-te a ni tuohin mawna’ vanglietna nei-ah a om uhi, ci-in kang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kigielsa bangin: “Midih koima a om sih a, khat zong a om sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a thei khat zong a om sih a, Pasien a sui khat zong a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zosie lam a piel sieng vua, kimanna nei lo a suohton ta uhi; a hoi-a gamta koima a om sih a, khat nangawn a om sih hi,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A lawl uh hankhuh kihong bang a, zuou genna-in a leii a zang uhi.; “A nephu nei vuah gulgu a om hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A kam uh pen hamsiet le kamkha tawh a kidim hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Sisan a suo dingin a kal uh a naw suon vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />a lampite vuah sietna le lungzinna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in nopna lampi a thei sih uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A mittang vuah Pasien zatahna om lo hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kam kici zosie a kihum thei nading le leitung mi vannuoi in Pasien mai-ah sittelna a thuoh thei nadingin, thukham in a gen popo pen thukham nei-a om mite kunga a gen ahi lam tu-in eite in i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thukham tungtawnin mawna a op lam a kithei ziehin, thukham banga gamtatna ziehin mihingte koima in ama mai-ah dih a tang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in ahile thukham loin Pasien’ dihna kilang zo ta a, thukham le kamsangte in tam thu-ah teci a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua khu a um mi vannuoi adingin Jesu Khris upna tungtawna a kipie Pasien’ dihna ahi hi. Tua ahi zieh in kilamdanna a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie maw uh ahi ziehin Pasien’ minthanna a tang zo ta sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jesu Khris sunga a om tatkhietna ziehin letsong ahi Pasien’ hepina tawh tu-in amate dih kitangsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Upna ziehin ama’ sisan tawh thoidamna biehpiehna-a kipie dingin Pasien in ama a koi ta hi. Tami khu ama’ dihna a lahna ahi hi, azieh pen Pasien in ama’ lungduoina sungah a tawpsa huna mawnate a ciemte nawn sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tu hunin amama zong dih a, tua in Jesu a um mite dih a tansahna thu a lah nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahile i kisielpi ding uh bang om ahei? Tua khu a kipuse zo ta hi. Bang thukham zieha kipuse ahiei? Zui ding thukham amah? Hi lo hi, upna thukham zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi khat thukham zuina zieh hi loin upna ziehin dih kitangsah zo hi, ci-in eite in i pom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi sihle Pasien pen Jew mite’ Pasien beh amah? Gentile-te’ Pasien zong ahi sih amah? Hima hi, Gentile-te’ Pasien zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pasien khat beh ahi hi; tua Pasien in a upna ziehun Jew mite dih a tansah bangin, ama in a tep kitan lote zong tua upna tungtawn ma-in dih a tangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahile tami upna thu hang tawh eite in thukham i paimang ta uh amah? Tua bang hi vawt lo hi! Tuale mahin thukham a kipsah zaw i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile i pu uh Abraham in tahsa lam tawh a na nga phattuomna khu eite in bang i gen ding vuoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen gamtatna zieha Abraham dih kitangsah ahile ama in kisah thei nading thu pawlkhat nei hi, hinanle tua pen Pasien mai-ah ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lai Siengtho in bang a gen ei? “Abraham in Pasien um a, tua pen ama tungah dihna-in kisimpieh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nasem mi khat tunga a kipie a thaman pen letsongin kisimpieh loin sep thaman kici zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin mi khat in na a sep lo vangin ama in migilote dih tangsah pa a muon leh, tua bang upna pen dihna-in kisimpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ma bangin sepna kihal lo, Pasien in midih hi, ci-a a sim mite’ hamphatna thu David in zong tam bangin gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“A tatkhielnate uh kimaisah a, a mawnate uh a kisinpieh mite mi hampha ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in ama’ mawna a ciepte lo pa mi hampha ahi hi,” a ci hi .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahile tami hamphatna pen teptan mite tung beha kipie amah? Ahi sihle teptan lo mite tunga zong kipie ahei? Eite in, “Abraham upna pen dihna-in kisimpieh hi,” i ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahile tua pen bang hun pana kisimpieh ahei? A teptan masang amah? Ahi sihle a teptan zaw ahei? A teptan zaw hi loin a teptan masang hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Teptan ahi nai lo lai-in upna zieha a na neisa dihtanna ciemtena dinga ama in tua teptanna lim a na nga hizaw hi. A deina in ama pen a tep kitan lo thu um mi zosie le a upna uh dihna-a a kisimpieh mi zosie’ pupi a suo thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ma bangin ama pen a tep kitante’ pupi beh hi loin, tep a kitan masanga i pa uh Abraham in a na nei a ettehuoi upna thu a zui mite adingin zong pupi a suo nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in leitung luo dingin Abraham le a suonlehlahte tungah a kamciem pen thukham zuina zieh ahi sih a, upna zieha dihtatna tawh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thukham zuite beh gouluo ding hi poma leh upna pen bangma lo ahi ta ding a, thuciemna zong a mawhna a suoh ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukham in Pasien’ lungthahna piengsah hi; ahi vangin thukham a op lona munah tatkhielna zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin tua kamciem pen hepina tunga kinga ahi thei nading le ama’ suonlehlahte zosie tungah thukip ahi thei nadingin, thukham zuite beh in nga loin Abraham’ upna banga a um mite in zong a nga thei nadingin upna bulphu-a kipie ahi hi. (Bangzieh ahei cile Abraham pen eite zosie’ pa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Minam tampite’ pa dingin kang bawl zo hi,” ci-in a kigiel ma bangin), ama in misite hingsahin a om nai lote a omsah pa ahi a up pa Pasien muna-ah eite zosie’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama kungah, “Na suon na hlahte tam bangin tam ding hi,” ci-a a kigen ma bangin, “Minam zosie’ pa,” ahi thei nading lametna om lopi-in ama in a muong kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama’ pumpi a si zo tawh a kibahna thu le (azieh pen ama kum zakhat bang pha ta hi) Sarah’ nau nei thei lona thute a ngaisut ciengin upna lamah a tha a kiem tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien’ kamciemna tungtang thu-a muonlana in ama a hawisah zo sih a, a upna sungah thakhau semsemin Pasien’ min thangsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien in a kamciem ang tangtun zo tahtah ding hi, ci-in a um lenlon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a upna pen, “Ama adingin dihna-in kisimpieh hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in, “Ama adingin kisimpieh hi,” ci-a kigiel kammalte ama ading beha kigiel ahi sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />eite ading zong ahi hi. Misite lah panin i Topa Jesu a thosah pa a um eite tungah tua upna pen dihna-a ei kisimpieh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eite’ khielna ziehin a si dingin ama kipie a, eite’ dihtan nadingin ama kithosah zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin upna ziehin dih tang zo i hi ziehin, eite in Topa Jesu Khris tungtawnin Pasien tawh kilemna i nei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama tungtawnin i opna uh tami hepina sungah eite in lut theina thu i nga zo ta uhi; tuale eite in Pasien tawh minthanna a ngaton dingin i kinep ziehun i kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua tham loin i thuoh gimnate vuah zong eite i kipah veve vua, tua gimnate in thuoh zawhna piengsahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thuoh zawhna in gamtat hoi piengsah a, gamtat hoi in lametna piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua lametna in eite ei lungkiesah lo hi, bangzieh ahei cile eite tunga ei kipie Hlagau Siengtho tungtawnin eite’ lungsim sungah Pasien’ itna ang kibuosuh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite thanem-a i op laitah a kilawm hunin Pasien thei lote adingin Khris ang si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin ci leih mi hoi khat adingin a si ngam mi om kha phiel nanle midih khat adingin a si ngam mi kikhat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin mawnei mi i hi laitahin eite adingin Khris ang sina ziehin Pasien in eite ei itna thu ei lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin tu-in ama’ sisan ziehin dihtansah i hi ngalun, ama tungtawnin Pasien’ lungthahna panin hutdamin i omzaw kan lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen galte i hi lai bawnun ama Tapa’ sina tungtawnin Pasien tawh na kilem thei sam i hi uleh, i kilem zaw ciengin ama’ hinna ziehin hutdamin i om zaw kan lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua teng beh ahi khop sih a, tu-in ama tungtawna kilemna i ngana uh ahi i Topa Jesu Khris tungtawnin Pasien tung nangawnah i kisiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mi khat vangin leitungah mawna tung a, mawna ziehin sina a tung hi. Tuale mi zosie maw zo ta ahi ziehin mikim tungah sina a kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thukham a op masang lai pehin leitungah mawna a om zo ta bo a, ahi vangin thukham a op lo lai-in mawna pen mawna-in na kisim lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle Adam huna kipanin Moses hun dongin Adam’ palsatna bang ma-in a khiel lote tung nangawnah zong sina in a uh hi. Tua Adam pen ang pei ding pa’ lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite ei kihlawnpieh letsong pen thupalsatna tawh kibang lo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile mi khat’ thupalsatna ziehin mi tampi in silaw uh ahile, Pasien’ hepina le mi khat ahi Jesu Khris’ hepina sunga ei kihlawnpieh letsong pen mi tampi adingin kicing tahtah zawkan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kihlawnpieh letsong le mi khat’ mawna zieha a pieng thu kibang lo hi. Bangzieh ahei cile thupalsatna khat ziehin thukhenna in mawsahna tun a, ahi vangin thupalsatna tampite ziehin ei kihlawnpieh letsong in dihtanna tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat’ thupalsatna ziehin sina in tua mi khat tungtawnin ei uh ahile, a kicing hepina le a kihlawnpieh dihna letsong a sangte in mi khat ahi Jesu Khris tungtawnin a nuntahna sung vuah uh zawkan lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mi khat’ thupalsatna in mi zosie adingin mawsah thukhenna a tut bangin, mi khat’ a dih gamtatna in zong mi zosie adingin dihtanna le hinna thu tun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat’ thuman lona in mi tampitah mawnei a suosah bang lienin mi khat’ thumanna in mi tampite midih a suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin thupalsatna a tam semsem nadingin thukham ang pei hi; ahi vangin mawna khanna munah hepina khangzaw sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua khu sina sungah mawna in a uh bang lien ma-in i Topa Jesu Khris tungtawnin kumtawn hinna a tunpi dingin hepina in dihna tungtawnin a uh thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile bang i gen ding vuoi? Hepina a khan thei nadingin mawna bawlbawl ding i hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawlbawl buong lo e! Mawna thu-a a sisa eite in bangci bangin tua mawna sungah hing thei lai ding i hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris Jesu sungah a ki-baptize sa eite zosie pen ama’ sina sungah zong a ki-baptize sa i hi lamtah thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin sina-ah i ki-baptize ziehin ama tawh a kivuiton i hi vua, tuaci’n Pa’ vanglietna tawh misite lah panin Khris ang thawkia ma bangin eite zong hinna tha-ah i hin thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen a sina sungah ama tawh pum khat i suo leh, a thawkiana sungah zong ama tawh pum khat i suoh tahtah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite in mawna pumpi kisusie-in mawna sungah sal tanga i op nawn lo nadingin Khris tawh singlamte tungah i milui uh kikhailia zo hi, ci thu i thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a sisa mi khat popo pen mawna pana a suohta zo ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jesu tawh i siton zo uleh ama tawh zong i hington ding hi, ci thu i um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile misite lah pana a thokia Khris pen si ngai nawn lo ding hi, ci thu i thei hi; sina in zong ama tungah thu a nei thei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama’ thuoh sina pen mawna thu-ah a kimang den ding khatvei sina hi a, ahi vangin ama’ hinna pen Pasien adinga hing ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n noma mama zong mawna lamah si-in Pasien lamah Jesu Khris ziehin a hinga na kingaisut ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin a si thei na pumpi sung vuah na tahsa uh’ deina ang zuisah thei ahi mawna in thu neisah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na pumpi nate uh gitlona vanzah dingin mawna-ah na pie nawn sih unlen, sina pan tho-in hinna a ngasa mite bangin dihna vanzah dingin Pasien tungah na pumpi uh’ nate na piezaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukham nei-ah na om nawn sih vua, hepina nei-ah om zo ta na hi ziehun note tungah mawna in thu a nei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahile bang himawh ahei? Thukham nei-ah om nawn loin hepina nei-ah om ta i hi ziehin eite in mawna i bawl nading vuoi mah? Bawl nawn buong lo e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sila thumangte bangin mi khatpo kungah noma mama na kipieh uleh tua a thu na man pa uh’ sila na hi pai ta vua, sina ang tut mawna sila ahi a, dihna ang tut thumanna sila ahi zongin, khat zawzaw’ sila na hi lam thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin nidang lai-in mawna sila ahi ngai note in lungsim tahpi tawh na tung vua ang ki-apsa thuhilnate na man zo tah ziehun Pasien kungah nuom thu i tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note pen mawna panin suohta-in dihna’ sila na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tahsa hindan uh a zawngkhal ziehin mihing’ ham banga kang gen ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile nidang lai-in siengtho lona le gitlona a bawl semsem dingin na pumpi nate na pieh bang lien ma-un, tuaci’n tu-in a siengtho hinkhuo adingin dihtanna lamah sal bangin na pumpi nate na pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna’ sila na hi lai-un dihna tawh kisai thu-ah a suohta na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahile tulai taha na zumpi uh nate panin bang phattuomna nga na hi uh ahei? Tua nate’ tawpna lampi khu sina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in ahile mawna panin suohta-in Pasien’ sila na hi ta uhi. Note in na nga uh phattuomna in sienthona hi a, lam tawpna khu kumtawn hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen mawna’ thaman in sina hi a, ahi vangin Pasien ei’ hlawnpieh letsong ahile Topa Jesu Khris sunga a om kumtawn hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, a hin sung teng beh thukham in mi khat tungah thu nei hi, ci na thei sih uh amah? Azieh pen thukham theite tunga thu gen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin pasal nei numei khat, a pasal a hin laisie thukham in a pasal tawh a khitha hi; ahi vangin a pasal a si leh tua numei pen a pasal tawh kisai thukham panin a suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ma bangin a pasal hin sungin pasal dang a kinunpi leh ama pen angkawmnu kici ding hi. Ahi vangin a pasal a si leh tua thukham panin ama a suohta ahi a, midang khat a kinunpi leh zong ama pen angkawmnu ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ma bangin ka lawmte aw, Pasien ading ga na ga thei nading ule midang kici misite lah pana kithosah pa-a’ na hi thei nadingun, Khris pumpi ziehin thukham lamah a si na hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cilesa sungah i nuntah lai-un thukham in mawna bawlnopna lungsim thosah a, i pumpi nate sungah si nading ga i ga nadingin na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin tu-in a kigiel thukham lui khut nei-ah om loin Hlagau hinkhuo tha sungah i hin thei nadingin ei hencip thukham thu-ah i si zo ta vua, tua panin i suohta ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile bang gen ding i hei? Thukham khu mawna ahi amah? Hi laizang lo e! Ahi vangin thukham na om lo hi leh mawna kici a thei kha ding ka hi sih hi. Thukham in, “Na deigaw sih ding hi,” na ci lo hi leh deigawna bang ahei ci zong ka thei kha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin mawna in thupieh sungah hun lem sui-in ka sungah deigawna namcin a piengsah hi. Thukham om loin mawna pen a si ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in thukham om loin ka na hing a, ahi vangin thupieh ang tun ciengin mawna hing kia-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kei ka si a, hinna ding ei kamciem tua thupieh tehteh pen ma kei adingin sina ang lehi zaw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen thupieh sungah mawna in hun lemtang sui-in ei sol a, tua tawh ei that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n thukham pen a siengtho hi a, thupieh zong siengtho-in dihin hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahile sil hoite in kei tungah sina ang tun ahi amah? Tua bang hi laizang lo e! Mawna pen mawna tahtah ahi lam a kilah nadingin sil hoi tungtawnin mawna in keima sungah sina na a sem ahi hi. Thupieh tungtawnin mawna pen tezawh lo a siehuoi mama ahina thu kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukham pen hlagau lam thu ahi, ci i thei hi; ahi vangin kei ka hile cilesa tawh om mi ka hi a, mawna sungah sila banga ei kizua ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka gamtatna mama zong ka thei sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ka bawl nop teng ka bawl sih a, ka huot teng ka lebawl zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in ka bawl nop lo teng ma bawl veve ka hi leh kei pen thukham hoi hi, ci-a a thukimpi ka hi mawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua bang a bawl tahtah pen kei ka hi nawn sih a, ka sunga a teng mawna ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen ka tahsa pumpi sungah sil hoi khat beh a ten lo lam ka thei hi. A pha bawl ding ka lunggul vangin ka bawl thei vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen ka bawl nuom sil hoi ka bawl sih a, ka bawl nuom lo gitlona ka lebawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in ka bawl nuom lo pen bawl ka hi leh a bawl pen kei ka hi nawn sih a, ka sunga a teng mawna’ bawl ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n sil hoi ka bawl nop ciengin ka kungah sietna ang om hi, ci thu khat ka mukhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka sunglam mi in Pasien’ thukham sungah nuom sa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ahi vangin ka pumpi nate sunga om thukham dang khat le ka lungsim thukham kido a, tua in ka pumpi nate sunga a teng mawna thukham sungah sala ei mat lam ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi genthei lah ka hi mawh in! Tami sina pumpi panin koi in ei hunkhie ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris ziehin Pasien tungah lungdam ka ko hi! Tuaci’n ka lungsim tawh Pasien thukham’ sila ka hi a, ahi vangin ka tahsa tawh mawna thukham’ sila ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Khris Jesu sunga a omte adingin tu-in mawsah thukhenna a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen Jesu Khris sunga om hinna Hlagau’ thukham in mawna le sina thukham panin note ang suohtasah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cilesa zieha a thanem thukham in a bawl zawh lote, Pasien in a bawl zo hi; ama in mawna thoidam nadingin mawna kidim cilesa mel a puo ama’ Tapa ang sawlna tawh cilesa sunga om mawna tungah thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami in cilesa deina bang hi loin Hlagau’ deina banga a kalsuon eite sungah thukham in a kalh dihna thu a tangtun nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile cilesa deina banga a nungtate in a lungsim vuah cilesa tawh kisai thute a lunggul vua, ahi vangin Hlagau deina banga a nungtate in Hlagau tawh kisai thute ma a lunggul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cilesa tawh kisai thute lunggulna in sina hi a, Hlagau tawh kisai thute lunggulna in hinna le lungmuonna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin cilesa tawh kisai lunggulna pen Pasien gal bawlna ahi a, tua in Pasien’ thukham a zui sih a, zong a zui thei mawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cilesa sunga a om mite in Pasien a lungdamsah thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin na sung vuah Pasien’ Hlagau ang ten ziehin note pen cilesa sunga om na hi sih vua, Hlagau sunga om na hi uhi. Khris’ Hlagau a nei lo poma Khris-a’ ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin na sung vuah Khris a op leh mawna ziehin na pumpite uh a si vangin dihna ziehin na Hlagau uh a hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na sung vuah misite lah panin Jesu a thosah ama’ Hlagau ang ten leh misite lah panin Khris a thosah pa ahi ama in na sung vua a teng ama’ Hlagau tungtawnin a si thei na pumpite uzong hinna ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin sanggamte aw, eite pen cilesa deina zui dinga cilesa tunga leibate i hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen cilesa deina banga na hin uleh na si ding vua, ahi vangin Hlagau ziehin pumpi gamtatnate na thalia uleh na hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ Hlagau in a pui mite zosie Pasien’ tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Azieh pen note in zauna sunga puakia nading sila hina hlagau na nga sih vua, tapa hina hlagau a nga zo na hizaw uhi. “Abba! Pa!” ci-a i kiko ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien’ tate i hi, ci thu tua Hlagau ma in eite’ hlagau tawh teci a pangton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n tate i hi uleh gouluote, Pasien’ gouluote le Khris tawh gouluo tonte i hi vua, Khris tawh i thuohton tahpi uleh eite zong ama tawh i minthangton ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhun taha i thuoh gimnate pen khatvei ciengin eite tunga minthanna ang kilang ding pen tawh tekah tah ka sa vet sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kisiem nate in lawptahin Pasien’ tate kilah ding kal a ngahla mama uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />azieh pen a kisiem nate kimanna nei lo suoh a, tua pen amau’ nop thu hi loin lametna sungah kimanna a nei lo a suohsah pa’ deina banga pieng ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kisiem nate mama zong a muot dinga a kihenna panin kihlakhie-in a vanglien Pasien tate’ suohtatna a nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhun dongin a kisiem na vannuoi nausuoh takei natna vei bangin tau-in a om uhi, ci i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kisiem nate beh ahi sih a, Hlagau’ ga masate a nei eite mama in zong tate ei suohsah ding ahi i pumpite uh tatkhietna ni ngah kawmin i sungtawng vuah khuisa-in i tau vangut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen lametna sungah hutdamin i om zo ta uhi. Tu-in i musate i lametna pen lametna hi lo hi. Bang ding ahei cile koi in a musate lamen na lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite in i mu nai lote i lamet ciengin lungduoi tahin i ngah ngetngut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ma bangin i thanemna ah Hlagau in eite ei panpi hi; azieh pen eite in nget dinga kilawmte i ngen thei sih vua, ahi vangin tua Hlagau mama in kamtenga gen thei lo tauna tawh eite adingin ei thumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lungsim a sui Pasien in tua Hlagau’ lungsim a thei hi, bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ deina dung zui-in Hlagau in misiengthote adingin a thumpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien a it mite, ama’ ngimna dung zui-a a hlatsa mite adingin sil bangkim in a hoi lamin a seppieh hi, ci thu i thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasien’ Tapa pen a kunta mama innkuon sungah tacil ahi thei nadingin ama in a theikholsa mite, a Tapa’ lim sun dinga a laitansa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in tua banga a laitansate hlanin a hlatsate dih tangsah pai a, dih a tansahsate zong a min a thangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahile tam thu tungtang ah bang i gen ding vuoi? Eite lamah Pasien a pan po leh eite lang khatah koi pang zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A Tapa khat neisun sit loin eite zosie adinga ei piekhie Pasien in adang na vannuoi zong a Tapa tawh ei pieton loin a om ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasien’ teelsa mite koi in mawsah ding ahei? Dih ei tangsah pa pen Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mawsah thukhen ding koi pen ahiei? Sina a thuoh beh tham loin sina panin thokia a, Pasien’ zietlamah a om, eite adinga thu ei ngetpieh pa khu Khris Jesu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Koi in Khris’ itna panin ei khen zo ding ahei? Hamsatna, lungmanna, bawlsietna, gilkielna, zawnna, zauhuoina, le namsaute in ei khen zo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lai Siengtho sungah, “Nangma ziehin sunthapai-in thana ka thuoh uhi; a kigo ding tuu bangin ei kisim hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bangma in ei khen zo vawt sih ding a, eite ei it ama ziehin bangkimah guolzo pente i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azieh pen sina ahi a, hinna ahi zongin, vantung mite ahi a, thuneite ahi zongin, tuhun nate ahi a, ang tung ding nate ahi zongin, vanglietna neite ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />a sangna ahi a, a thuhna ahi zongin, adang a kisiem na vannuoi lahah na khat beh in i Topa Jesu Khris sunga Pasien’ ei itna tawh ei khen zo vawt lo ding hi, ci thu ka theitel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khris sungah thutah ka gen a, ka zuou ahi sih hi; kei le kei ka kitheina lungsim in tua khu Hlagau Siengtho tawh a kipsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka lungsim sungah dana lienpi le a tawp thei lo lunggimna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile cilesa panin ka mipi ka unaute tangin Khris panin kei mama samsiet le pampai-in om mai leng ka nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate pen Israel-te ahi vua, tapa hina, minthanna, thuciemna, thukham piehna, biehpiehna, le kamciemte zosie amau-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tanglai pupite zong amau-a’ ma ahi a, cilesa lam panin cilei Messiah zong amate sung pana ang pieng ahi hi. Na zosie a uh Pasien phat zingin om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam bang ka ci ciengin Pasien’ kammal tangtung lo hi, a ci ka hi sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile Israel-te zosie zong Israel mi tahtah ahi kim sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham’ tate zosie zong ama’ suonlehlah tahtah hi kim tuon lo hi; “Isaac tungtawnin na suonlehlahte a min kivaw ding hi,” kici zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami in Pasien’ tate i ci pen cilesa lam pana tate hi lo a, kamciem tawh a kipawl tate beh suonlehlah a kisim hizaw hi, a ci nuom ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen tua kamciem in, “Tuhun pawl ciengin kang kilekia ding a, Sarah in tapa khat nei ding hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua teng beh zong ahi tham sih hi; Rebecca in a pasal ahi i pupi uh Isaac tawh nau ang paai ciengin ama tungah zong tua bang ma-in a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A suo masang nangawn ule a sie le a pha khatpo a bawl thei masangun (teelna tawh kisai Pasien’ lungtup a kizop suoh nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sepna tawh hi loin ama’ hlatna tawh) Rebecca kungah, “A tazaw pa in a nauzaw pa’ na sem ding hi,” na kici zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ma bangin, “ Keima in Jacob ka it vangin Esau ka muda hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahile bang i gen ta ding vuoi? Pasien a thutang lo ahi mawh ta diei? Tua bang hi buong lo e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in Moses kungah, “Ka hepi nuomte ka hepi ding a, ka khuotuo nuomte ka khuotuo ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n tam thu pen mihingte’ deina le hanciemna zieh hi loin Pasien’ hepina zieh hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen Lai Siengtho in Pharoah kungah, “Nangma sungah ka vanglietna ka lah thei nading le leitung zosie-ah ka min a kiphuongzah thei nading ngimna tawh nang kang lamto zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in hepi dinga a teel mi poma hepi a, a lungkhau dinga a teel mi poma lungkhausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahile, “Bang ziehin ama in mite mawsah lailai ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile koi in ama’ deina nang zo ding ahei?” na ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien tawh a kisel dingin nang mihing koi tahtah na hi ahei? A kibawl sil khat in a bawlpa kungah, “Bang dinga nei hici bawl ahei?” a ci ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Beelkheng pa in tungman lom khat panin a thupi zawdeu a zah ding le a thangzah dingin bawl theina thu nei hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien in a lungthahna lah nuomin ama’ vanglietna a kitheisah nuom ziehin, ama in a kisie dinga kibawlsa lungthahna beelte lungduoi tahin thuoh ngetngut ahile bang gen nawn ding i hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama’ minthan nadinga a bawl kholsa, a khuotuona a nga mite tungah ama in a kicing a minthanna a theisah nadingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />a hlatsate lah panin Jew mite beh hi loin Gentile-te lahah eite zong tua bangin ei hlan ahile bang gen nawn ding i hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in Hosea sungah, “Ka mi hilote tungah, ‘ka mite’ na hi uhi, ka ci ding a, a ki-it lo nu zong ‘ka it mi’ ka ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate kungah, “Ka mite hi sih uteh,’ ci-a a kigenna mun ma-ah amate, ‘A nungta Pasien’ tate,’ kici ding hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel tawh kisai-in Isaiah in a tangkona-ah, “Israel’ tate pen tuipi gei-a senel za-in a tam vangin, asangh teng beh in hutdamna nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in leitungah mallang tah le kiptahin thu a khen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Isaiah in tam thu a genkholna-ah, “Vanglien Topa in eite adingin a hinglaite ei nuasie lo hileh Sodom khuo mite i bang ding vua, Gomorrah khuo mite bangin ei kibawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahile eite in bang i gen ding vuoi? Dihna nga nading a hanciem lo ahi Gentile-te in a nga zo ta uhi, tua pen upna tungtawna a nga uh dihna ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ahi vangin thukham bulphu-in dihna nga ding a hanciem Israel-te in thukham a zui zo kim sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile amate in upna bulphu-in a hanciem sih vua, sepna bulphu-in a hanciem zieh uh ahi hi. Kipalpuana suongah amate a kipalpua ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“En un, mite kipal nading suong, amate a puasah ding suongpi khat Zion ah ka koi a, ama a um mi poma kimaizumsah lo ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, amate dinga ka lunggulna le Pasien kunga ka thungetpiehna ahile amate hutdam-a a op thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate Pasien lamah a pawnthaw mama vua, hinanle theina dih a nei lo lamtah uh teci ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in Pasien kung pana ang pei dihna a thei lo zieh ule amau’ dihna a kip thei nading a sui ziehun Pasien’ dihna thu a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen thukham a tawpna Khris ahi a, tua khu a um mi vannuoi in dihna a nga thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukham pana ang pei dihna tawh kisai-in Moses in, “Tam nate banga a gamta mi in tamte ziehin a hing ding hi,” ci-in a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin upna pana ang pei dihna tawh kisai-in, “Na lungsim sungah, ‘Vantungah koi va kato ding ahei?’ ci sin.” (tua pen Khris lasuh ding ci na ahi hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi sihle, ‘Taw nei lo leihawm thuhpi sungah koi kumsuh ding ahei?’ zong ci sin,” a ci hi. (Tua pen misite lah panin Khris lato ding ci na ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua in bang gen ahei? Tua thu pen nang tawh a kinai a, na kam le na lungtang sungah a om hi,” a ci hi. (Tua pen ka gen uh upna thu ahi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Jesu pen Topa ahi hi, ci-in na kam tawh pulahin, na lungtang sungah Pasien in misite lah panin ama thosah zo hi, ci-a na up leh hutdamna na nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen mi khat in a lungtang tawh a up ziehin dihna nga a, a kam tawh a pulah ziehin hutdamna nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lai Siengtho in, “Ama a um mi koima in maizumna thuoh lo ding hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Judah mi le Greek mi kikalah a kikhiehna a om sih hi. Tua Topa ma pen mi zosie’ Topa ahi a, ama’ min a lo mi zosie tungah phaltahin thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile, “ Topa’ min a lo mi zosie in hutdamna a nga ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a up lo pa uh kungah thu bangci nget thei ding uh ahei? Amate in a thu a zah ngai lo pa uh bangci up thei ding uh ahei? Thugen mi om sih leh amate in bang a ci zah thei ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kisawl sih leh amate in bang a ci gen thei ding uh ahei? A kigielsa bangin, “Lungdamna thu a phuongzah mite’ keng bang za-in etlawm ahei!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hizongle a unpi-un lungdamna thu a um kim sih uhi. Azieh pen Isaiah in, “ Topa aw, ka thugen uh koi in a um ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n zahna panin upna pieng a, Khris’ thu kihilna tungtawnin tua thu kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a za sih uh amah? ci-in ka dong leh amate in a za zo tahtah ta uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile, “A aw un leitung zosie zel zo a, a kammalte un leimong dong ban zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-te in a tel sih uh amah? ci-in ka dong hi. A masa penin Moses in, “Minam ahi lote a eng dingin kang bawl ding a, a mawlawm minamte ziehin kang lungthahsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaiah in hangtahin, “Ei sui lote in kei ei mu zo vua, ei kan lote kungah keima ma ka kilah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te tawh kisai-in ama in, “Thu mang loin a letat mite adingin sunthapai-in ka ban ka zah hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahile Pasien in a mite a nuol ta amah? ci-in ka dong hi. Nuol poma lo hi! Keima ma zong Israel mi ka hi a, Abraham’ suon, Benjamin minam ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien in a thei kholsa mite a nuol ngai sih hi. Israel-te langkhatah Pasien kunga a thum Elijah thu, Lai Siengtho in bangci gen ci thei lo na hi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa aw, amate in na kamsangte thatin na maitamte zong a susie gawp uhi; kei ngentang ka om ta bo a, amate in kei nangawn zong ei tha sawm lai uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in ama bangin a dawngkia ei? “Keima adingin Baal mai-ah a khupdin ngai lo mi tul sagi ka koi zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ma bangin tuhunin zong hepina tawh a kiteel mi themkhat om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua teelna pen hepina zieh ahile, sepna bulphu-a teelna ahi nawn sih hi, tua bang hi sihle hepina pen hepina hi nawn lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile bang ahi ta diei? Israel-te in a suisui pen a nga sih uhi. A teeltuom mite in nga a, ahi vangin adangte ahile a lung uh khau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a kigiel ma bangin, “Pasien in tuni dongin amate thadana lungsim, khuo a mu thei lo mittang le, khuo a za thei lo bilte a pie hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in zong, “A sabuoite uh thang le piel suoh hinlen, amate adingin puana le thuhkiana suoh taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate in khuo a mu lo nadingun a mit uh miel hinlen, a ngum uh kul den taheh,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pua nading dongun amate a kipalkha ta uh amah? ci-in ka dong hi. Tua bang hi lo hi! Ahi vangin amau’ puana ziehin Gentile-te tungah hutdamna thu a tun pen Israel-te’ thangsiet nadinga kibawl ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in amate puana pen leitung mite adingin hauna a suo a, amate guollelna zong Gentile-te adingin hauna suoh ahile, Khris sunga Jew mite zosie a kihuopkimna zong bangza tahin hauna suoh zawkan lai ding ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />No Gentile-te tunga thu ang gen ka hi hi. Gentile-te adinga sawltahpi ka hi ziehin ka nasepna a genpha ka hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua tawh ka mipite in ka etsah thei khah a, amate lahah mi pawlkhat ka hutdam thei khah leh ka ci na ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate kinuolna pen leitung mite tawh kilemkiana ahile, amate kipomkiana zong khu sina panin hinna lobuong bang dang hi ding ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ga masa-a kipie bunel lomkhat a sientho nah po leh bunel lompi zong a siengtho pai ahi hi; a zungpi a sientho nah po leh a bate zong a siengthosa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua a bate pawlkhat kisattanin tua munah gamlah olive dawng ahi note pen tuate tungah ang kipe-in tua olive zung pana ang pei khanna tui a dawnton na hi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin a bate tungah kisiel kha sih un. Na kisiel uleh a zungpi a puo tahtah pen no na hi sih vua, a zungpi in no ang puoh ahi zawh lam phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note in, “Kei ei kipe nadinga a bate kisattan ahi hi,” na ci ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua pen thuman ahi hi! Amate a kisattna pen a up lo zieh uh ahi a, ahi vangin note na hi uleh upna zieha amate munah a ding thei na hi bo uhi. Tua hi a, kisathei sih unlen zau zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in a ba ahi ngaite bawn za lo ahile note zong ang za tuom kha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ migitna le a khauna kithei un: Ama pen a puate tungah khau a, ahi vangin a migitna sunga na op suoh uleh note tungah ang migi ding hi; tua bang na hi sih uleh no zong ang kisattan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel-te nangawn zong uplana sunga a op suoh sih uleh kipekia veve ding hi, azieh pen Pasien in amate pekia thei nading thu a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note bawn pienpi gamlah olive kung panin ang kisattanin pienpi tawh kilebula a kisuon olive kung tungah ang kipe sam ahile, olive kungah tami pienpi a bate kipekia zawkan lai lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, no sangin ka pilzaw hi, na kici lo nadingun note in tam thuthuh na thei ding uh ka dei hi: Gentile-te a lut ding za ang lutkim masangsie Israel-te pawlkhat tungah lungkhauna a tung tadi phot ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hi a, Israel-te zosie in hutdamna a nga ding uhi; Lai Siengtho sungah, “Zion panin Tanpa ang pei ding a, ama in Jacob panin Pasien zatah lona a hemkhie ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Amau’ mawnate ka lahmang ciengin, tami khu amate tawh ka thuciemna ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungdamna thu tawh kisai-in na hamphat nadingun amate pen Pasien’ galte a suoh vua, ahi vangin teelna tawh kisai-in amate pen a pu a pate uh ziehin itte ahi veve uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Pasien’ letsongte le Pasien’ hlatna pen a kikhel thei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hun khat lai-in note in Pasien’ thu na mang sih vua, ahi vangin tu-in amau’ thuman lona ziehin hepina na nga ma bangun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />note tunga a kilah hepina ziehin amate in zong hepina a nga nadingun thumang loin a om tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in mi zosie a hepi nadingin thumanlona-ah mi zosie a khumcip phot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aw, Pasien’ hauna, pilna le theinate thuh talawm sam e izaw! A thukhennate kan zawh ding ahi sih a, a lampite zong thei zawh ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Azieh pen koi in Topa’ lungsim thei a, a thudawhpi-in koi pang ngai ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Ahi sihle letsong a thuhkia dingin koi in ama tungah letsong pie ngai ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na zosie, ama kung pan, ama tungtawn le ama ading ahi hi. Ama in minthanna nga zingzing taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin sanggamte aw, Pasien tungah a siengtho le a santah hingtang biehpiehna bangin na pumpite uh na pieh nadingun Pasien’ hepina zalin kang thum hi, tua khu na hlagau biehpiehna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tam leitung mite dan bangin om sih unlen, a hoi, a sanhuoi le a bukim Pasien’ deina bang ahei, ci-in na khinkhai thei nadingun na lungsim uh thasuosah unlen na lim uh na kilamdang sah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima ei kipie hepina ziehin note lah mi zosie tunga kang gen nuom thu in, na hina za sanga a sangzaw-in no le no na kingaisun sih unlen, Pasien in note ang pieh upna za tawh kizui-in a kilawm cieng bep khatin kingaisun zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite in pumpi khat tungah pumpi’ nate tampi i nei vua, tua nate zosie in a nasepnate uh a kibah lo ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a tampi ahi eite zong Khris sungah pumpi khat i hi vua, eite khatlekhat pumpi nate i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite ei kipie hepina tawh kizui-in letsong a tuom ciet i nei uhi: Kamsang za nga mi in a upna za tawh kituohin kamsang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nasepna za a nga mi in tua na sem taheh; thuhil za a nga mi in thuhil taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hansuona za a nga mi in hansuo taheh; a piekhie mi in kiphaltahin pie taheh; makai za a nga mi in kukal tahin makai taheh; lainatna nasep a sem mi in lungtai tahin sem taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Itna pen a tahtah hi heh; gitlona huo unlen sil hoi na tukon un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />khatlekhat na ki-it tuoh unlen ki-zatah bawlna lamah khatlekhat a sangzaw-in na kidem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawnthawna lamah na thasie sih unlen lungsim thalawp tahin Topa’ na sem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kinepna-ah lungdam unlen, gimna ang tun ciengin thuoh keikui-in thunget na pawnthaw mama un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misiengthote a kisapna bangin na hawm unlen, lengla na do siem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ang bawlsiete thupha na pie unlen, amate samsie loin thupha na pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lungdamte tawh lungdamton unlen, a kapte tawh kapton un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khatlekhat na kithuhuol un; kiliensah sih un; tuolniem mite tawh na kigop unlen, no le no a pilin na kingaisun sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khatpo’ gitlona pen gitlona ma tawh na thuhkia sih un. Mi zosie muna-ah a kilawm pen dingin na ngaisun zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi thei leh no thu ahi laisie mi zosie tawh na kilem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka itte aw, no le no phu na kila sih unlen, Pasien’ lungthahna dingin mun na awn zaw un; bangzieh ahei cile, “Phulahna keima-a’ ahi a, keima in ka thuhkia ding hi, ci-in Topa in a gen hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi lo hi, “Na galpa a gil a kiel leh an pie-in a dangta leh a dawn ding tui na pie un; azieh pen tam banga na bawlna ziehun a lutung vuah meikamsa a buohsuh na hi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sietna in kizo sah sih unlen sietna pen hoina tawh na zo zaw un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi zosie in uhna a nei mite’ thu mang uheh; azieh pen Pasien kung pan ci simlo thuneina a om thei sih a, uhna thuneite zong Pasien’ koi mite ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin uhna thunei mipa a langdo poma Pasien’ koisa mipa a langdo ahi a, tua bang a langdo mite in thukhenna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gam-uhte pen a gamtat hoi lo mite adingin a giinhuoi hi beh a, a gamtat hoi mite adingin a giinhuoi ahi sih hi. Thunei mipa giing loin na om nuom vuoi mah? Na op nuom uleh a hoi lamin gamta un, tua hile ama’ patahna na nga ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama pen na hoi nading vua Pasien’ nasempa ahi hi. Ahi vangin na gamtat siet uleh ama na giin ding uh ahi hi, azieh pen thunei pa in a mawhna-in namsau a tawi sih hi! Ama ahile a gamtatsie mite tungah lungthahna dan a pie ding Pasien’ nasem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama’ lungthahna na zauna zieh beh utawh hi loin, no le no kitheina lungsim tawh zong a thu man ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen thuneite ahile tam bang thute a buoipi Pasien’ nasemte ahi ziehun, tami thute zieh ma-in zong note in phiengsie na pieh uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nga ding vua kilawm bangin mi zosie tungah pie un, sieh nga dinga kilawmte sieh pie un, phiengsie nga dinga kilawmte phiengsie pie un, zatah dinga kilawmte zatah unlen, patawi dinga a kilawmte patawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khatlekhat ki-it ding ci simlo khatlekhat lei na kibasah sih un; bangzieh ahei cile midang a it pa in thukham’ deina a zui sieng ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ang kawm sin; tuol that sin; gu sin; mi neisa deigaw sin; a kici thupiehte le thupieh dang a om popo, “Nangma na ki-it bangin na vengpa it in,” a kici thupieh in a huom sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna in a vengpa’ sietna ding a bawl sih hi; tua ahi ziehin itna i ci pen thukham zosie zui bukimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam thu banah tuhun pen bang hun hi a, note adingin kimutna panin bangci khahlaw ding ci zong na thei uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile i upcil lai sangin eite adingin tu-in hutdamna ang nai zaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />zan hun tawpin sun hun ang nai ta hi. Tua ahile eite in khuomiel nasepnate pai-in khuovah galhiemte tawh kivon vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sun huna om bangin eite zong kilawm tahin gamta-in, guol nopna le zukhamna, huana lanna, thangtatna, kihauna le kihazatnate bawl sih vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuale mahin note in Topa Jesu Khris puon bangin sil unlen, tahsa lungkim nading bangma bawl sih un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upna lama zawngkhal mite na pawlbawl unlen, a ngaisutnate uh kinielpi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in an khat popo neh thei dingin a um vua, hinanle upna neu mite in ante lohing mete beh a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ne mite in a tang mite simmaw sih hinlen, a tang mite in zong a ne mite tungah thu khen sih heh; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in amate zong sang veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midang khat’ nasemte tungah thu khen ding koi na hi vuoi? A pupa uh mai-ah amate kip thei-in zong pua thei uhi. Tuale Topa in kipsah thei ahi ziehin amate a kip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in ni khat pen adang khat sangin a thupizaw-in a ngaisun uhi; adangte leuleu in ni zosie a kibangin a ngaisun uhi. Mi zosie in amau’ lungsim cietah kithei ciet ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni a tangte in Topa zatahna tawh a tan uh ahi hi. An ne mite in zong Pasien tungah lungdam ko veve ahi ziehin Topa zatahna ma tawh a ne ahi uhi; an tangte in zong Topa zatahna tawh a tang ahi a, Pasien tungah lungdam a ko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eima dinga a hing mi koima i om sih a, eima dinga a si zong koima i om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hin leh Topa adinga hing i hi a, i si le zong Topa ading ma-a si i hi uhi. Tua ahi ciengin i hing a, i si zongin Topa -a’ ma i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Khris in a sisa mite le a hinglai mite’ Topa ahi thei nadingin si-in a hingkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang in bang dinga na sanggam pa tunga thu na khen ahei? Ahi sihle bang dinga na sanggam pa na simmaw ahei? Azieh pen eite zosie zong i unpi-un Pasien’ thukhenna topha mai-ah a ding ciet ding i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen Lai Siengtho sungah, “Kei ka hin ma bangin ka mai-ah mi zosie khupdinin, leii zosie in Pasien phat ding uhi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin eite khat ciet in Pasien kungah i kungtung ciet i kisut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin khatlekhat thu kikhen nawn loin, midang khat’ peina lampi-ah a pal thei ding le a khahtan thei dingte i koi ngai lo nadingin i lungsim uh khensat va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in Topa Jesu sungah a siengtho lo bangma om lo hi, ci thei-in ka kizo hi; ahi vangin a siengtho lo-a a ngaisun mi khatpo adingin tua pen a siengtho lo hi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na nehna ziehun na sanggam pa’ lungsim na natsah uleh itna sungah a kalsuon na hi nawn sih uhi. Na an nehna ziehun Khris in a silaw mi khat’ siet nading piengsah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n mite in na hoinate uh a sie lamin kigensah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien’ manggam pen neh le dawn thute ahi sih a, Hlagau Siengtho sungah dihna, lungmuonna le kipahna hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua banga Khris ading na a sem mi in Pasien mai-ah a sanhuoi suohin mite’ lungkimpi zong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin kilem nading le khatlekhat kilapsang tuoh thei nading a piengsah thute delin hanciem vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An nehna ziehin Pasien’ nasepna susie sih un. A tahtahin na zosie siengtho a, hizongle na neh na tah ziehun midangte na puasah ule a khiel na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />na sanggamte a puasah thei na khatpopo ahi, an nehna, zu nehnate bawl lo ding hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na nei upna pen nangma le Pasien kikal thu hisah in. Man a sah uh nate ziehin amau le amau a kimawpai lo mite pen mi hampha ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lungkaa mite in a neh ule zong upna tawh a neh lo ziehun mawsah thukhenna a thuoh ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile upna pana a pei lo poma mawna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thahat eite in eima’ lungkim nading beh sui loin a thanem mite’ gitnat lonate i thuohpi ding uh kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eite zosie in i vengte hoi nadingin amate lungkimsah a, i khansuo ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen Khris zong ama le ama a kilungkimsah sih hi; hizongle Lai Siengtho sungah, “No ang zako mite’ ang zakona teng kei tung ang tu hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite in Lai Siengtho pana i nga thuohzawna le henepna ziehin lametna i nei nadingin nidang lai-a na kigiel popo eite thuhil nadinga kigiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuohzawhna le hanthotna’ Pasien in Khris Jesu’ deina tawh kituohin note khatlekhat kithuhuolin hing omsah ta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hile note zong aw khatin luongtonin Pasien le i Topa Jesu Khris Pa’ min na thangsah thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Khris in note ang san bangin Pasien’ minthan nadingin note zong khatlekhat na kisang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in i pupite tunga a na piehsa kamciemte a suhkip thei nadingin Pasien’ thuman thutah hangin Khris pen teptan mite’ nasem suohsah zo hi, ci-in kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua pen Gentile-te in ama’ hepina ziehin Pasien’ min a thansah thei nading uh ahi hi. Lai Siengtho sungah, “Tua ahi ziehin Gentile-te lahah kang pulah ding a, na min phatna la-in ka sa ding hi,” ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khatvei a genkiana-ah, “Gentile-te aw, a mite tawh lungdamton un,’ a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a cina le, “No Gentile-te zosie aw, Topa phat unlen, mi zosie in zong ama phat uheh,” a cikia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale Isaiah in, “Jessi’ zungpi ang meng ding a, Gentile-te uh ding mi khat ang khang ding hi; Gentile-te in ama a lamen ding uhi,” na ci leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hlagau Siengtho’ vanglietna ziehin lametna tawh note na kidimlet thei nadingun, lametna Pasien in kipahna zosie le upna zieha lungmuonna zosie tawh note hing dim taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka sanggamte aw, noma mama pen hoina bukim le theina zosie tawh kidimin khatlekhat a kihil thei dingin kang muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle note’ phawkia dingin keima in hangsantahin na kung vuah thu pawlkhat kang giel zo hi. Pasien in ei pieh hepina ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kei pen Gentile-te’ silpiehte pomtah ahi thei nading le Hlagau Siengtho in a siensuo thei nadingin, Gentile-te kungah siempu nasepna tawh Pasien’ lungdamna thu a gen ding Khris’ nasempa khat ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Khris Jesu sungah Pasien ading ka sepnate tungah kisiel nading thu ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Azieh pen sepna le genna tawh Khris in kei tungtawna a sepkhietsa nate simlo bangma kang gen ngam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien’ Hlagau vanglietna tawh lim le na lamdangte bawlin Jerusalem-a kipanin Illyricum gam dongah Khris’ lungdamna thu ka phuongzah sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin midangte phusa khuombul tunga a lam ka hi lo nadingin Khris’ min a kilaw khah lona munte-ah lungdamna thu gen ding pen keima’ lungtup ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Lai Siengtho sungah, “Ama’ thu a kigen ngai lona mite in a mu ding vua, ama’ thu a za ngai lote in a theitel ding uhi,” ci-a kigielsa bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note kunga kang haw ding ei khahtan zelzel pen tami thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanle tu-in tam kuol tengah ka sep nading mun a op tah lo zieh le na kung vua kang haw ding ka lunggul zaw kum tampi a phah tah ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Spain ka pei ciengin na kung uh kang pha nuom hi. Azieh pen ka khuolzinna-ah note tawh kimu-in bakhat sung i kithuo zaw ciengin ka pei nading munah nei puohkia ding uh ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanle tu tadi-in mi siengthote’ na a sem dingin Jerusalem ah ka pei phot ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Macedonia gam le Achaia gam sunga mite in Jerusalem-a om misiengtho a zawngte lahah a neisate uh a hawm nuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in tam bangin a sem nuom uhi, a tahtahin amate in tuate tungah leiba nei ahi uhi; azieh pen Gentile-te in Jew mite tawh Hlagau thupha ngaton uh ahile, amate in zong tahsa lam thupha tawh Jew mite a hu ding uh a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tami nasep manin amate tungah a kidongsa sumte ka pieh zaw ciengin, no kungah hing baang kawmin Spain gamah ka pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na kung vua kang haw ciengin Khris’ thupha a dimtah tawh kang tun ding lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note in i Topa Jesu Khris le Hlagau’ itna ziehin keima dingin Pasien kungah nahpi tahin thu ngetna tawh nei panpi nading ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judea gama om thu um lote’ khut sung panin keima suohta-in, mi siengthote in Jerusalem-a ka nasepnate ang pom thei nadingun thu nei ngetpieh dingun kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua khu Pasien’ deina tawh na kung vuah kipah tahin hing pei a, note tawh kithuo-in tha tha i ngaton thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kilemna ei pie Pasien in note zosie hing ompi taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cenchreae khuo-a om numei pawlpi upa ahi, i sanggam nu Phoebe pen mihoi ahi lam kang theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pen mi tampi le kei mama zong ei panpi khat ahi ziehin, a kisapna khatpopo-ah na hu unlen, misiengthote’ sep dinga a kilawm ahi ma bangin Topa’ min tawh ama na sang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khris Jesu sungah ka seppi Prisca le Aquila-te zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama gel pen kei dinga a si ngam ahi vua, ama gel tungah kei beh a lungdam ka hi sih a, Gentile hlattuom pawlpi zosie zong lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama gel’ inn a kikhawm hlattuom pawlpite zong ei na noset pieh un. Asia gamah Khris adinga a kikhel masa pen, ka lawm it Epaenetus ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note lahah nasep pawnthaw mama ahi Mary zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thongkiehpi le keima’ tanaute Andronicus le Junia zong ei na noset pieh un.; ama gel pen sawltahpite lahah mi thupi ahi vua, kei sangin zong Khris a um masa zawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa sungah ka it Ampliatus ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khris sunga i seppi uh ahi Urbanus le ka it Stachys-te ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khris sunga mi citah Apelles zong ei na noset pieh un. Aristobulus’ innkuonpite zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tanau Herodion zong ei na noset pieh un. Topa sunga a om Narcissus innkuonpite ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa sunga nasem Tryphaena le Tryphosa-te zong ei na noset pieh un. Topa sunga nasep pawnthaw ka lawm it Persis zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa sunga a kiteel Rufus ei na noset pieh un; keima in zong nu ka ci ama’ nu ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asyncritus, Phlegon, Hermes, Patrobas, Hermas le amate tawh a omton tanaute zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Philologus le Julia, Nereus le a sanggam nu, Olympas le amate tawh omton misiengthote zosie zong ei na noset pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note khatlekhat siengtho kitawpna tawh ei na noset pieh un. Hlattuom Khris’ pawlpi zosie in note ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sanggamte aw, note in na sinsa uh ahi thuhilna tawh ki-elngat, pawl kikhenna le khielna a piengsah mite encienin pel un, ci-in kang hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua bang mite pen i Topa Khris’ na sem ahi ngap sih vua, amau’ ankam tui nading bepin kamsiem le mi maitang phatna tawh mimawlte’ lungsim sol ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen thu na manna uh mi zosie in thei ahi ziehin note vangin ka kipah a, thuhoi lamah mipil na hi ding ule, thusie lamah maw baang lo na hi ding uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nopsahna Pasien in a sawt loin Satan tuoncilin na keng nei vuah ang koi ding hi. Note tawh i Topa Jesu Khris’ hepina hing om taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka naseppi Timothy in ang noset a, tua ma bangin ka tanaute ahi Lucius, Jason le Sosipater-te in zong ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam laigiel pa ahi keima Tertius in zong Topa’ min tawh kang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Keima le hlattuom pawlpi buppi zin ei do Gaius in zong note ang noset hi. Khuopi sumkem pa Erastus le i sanggam pa uh Quartus-te in ang noset uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I Topa Jesu Khris’ ei hepina note zosie tawh hing om taheh. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in kum sawtveipi sung a kiselcip thuthuh kilahna tawh kizui-in keima in ka hil lungdamna thu le Jesu Khris’ thu tangkona tawh note ang thakhausah thei pa pen Pasien ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />hizongle tawntung Pasien’ thupieh dung zui le kamsangte’ gielsa thute tungtawnin Gentile-te zosie tungah theisahin upna thu aman thei nadingun ama in tu-in tua thu a pholah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jesu Khris tungtawnin a pil Pasien khat beh tungah minthanna om tawntung taheh! Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
